A closure that wraps the variable it writes. The store is not unrolled to the
chain depth: inside a value stored to the variable, a load of the variable
stands for the leaves of its values with their Wrap Chains cut, so the Wrap is
added once: over the variable's other values, and over "any value of the
variable" (the entry marked chain truncated).
